  "description": "In Gyeongseong, the city of glittering lights and glamorous desire, Gyeongseong Detective Agency has opened its doors at No. 45, District 1, Myeongchijeong. Sohwa, a 16-year-old servant girl, has nothing to her name but her wits and bravery. When she accidentally gets caught up in a secret scheme, she meets Jeong Haegyeong, a young man running his own detective agency. Chased by memories from the past, they must work together to clear her name.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63855150), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B2%BD%EC%84%B1%ED%83%90%EC%A0%95%EC%82%AC%EB%AC%B4%EC%86%8C/4011)",
